  <item>
    <title>vol.21 《花儿与少年5》为什么这样红</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9f7e6513a776b5739db75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c9f7e6513a776b5739db75</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Feb 2024 10:50:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年快乐！先和听到这期节目的每一个听众拜年啦！🧨🎆🥳</span><br><span>半年更播客竟然春节期间又录了一期😏本期节目再次请到我台老朋友虾仁猪和婧婧，聊聊最近令编辑部都上头的</span><strong><span>《花儿与少年·丝路季》</span></strong><span>。</span><br><span>这季花少在豆瓣评分已经达到9.1，作为一档老牌综艺做到了第5季竟成了系列里评分最高的一季，到底它有什么魅力呢？一起听听看吧！</span></p><p><span>🌷🌷🌷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 婧婧现场表演小才艺——插花（成果请见封面图）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 到了冰岛这里，这一季花少在虾仁猪的地位上升了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 节目不仅会让人笑还让人哭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 为什么这一季会那么好看</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 有东北人的综艺就挺有意思</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 如果要推荐这个节目，我们会怎么说？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 和《花少3》的对比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 这个节目里有几十对cp，请按需所磕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 辛芷蕾的直率让我们都很respect</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 旅途中的i人和j人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 每个人都很喜欢秦岚（大波哥讲述的过程中竟然一度哽咽）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 王安宇有破碎感？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 胡先煦的浪漫和体贴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 胡言乱语cp</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 辛甘秦愿cp</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a> 赵昭仪表现已经很不错了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> 对女顶迪丽热巴的改观</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">64:45</a> 多巴胺cp</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">66:00</a> 秦海璐是个能人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">76:00</a> 一璐平安cp</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4608">76:48</a> 一生辛胡cp</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4805">80:05</a> 花少导演请看过来，下一季人马已经帮你码好了</span></p>]]></description>
