  <item>
    <title>vol.20 《繁花》蛮灵额，但我们不懂爱情</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c0b1eadde969cfdc5bf54a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c0b1eadde969cfdc5bf54a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Feb 2024 10:01:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔半年的更新，我们一起来聊聊《繁花》</span></p><p><span>💐💐💐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 《繁花》初印象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 宝酱可能是全网对汪小姐好感倒数的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 蚯蚓最喜欢的角色是玲子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 看不懂李李</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 三位女主和阿宝的关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 大波哥最爱的角色之一——葛老师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 进贤路F4可以自己开一档剧，像某种典型的日剧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 以卢美琳为首的黄河路配角们</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">66:30</a> 大波哥最爱的角色之二——范总</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4330">72:10</a> 去掉魏总这个角色也是合理的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4395">73:15</a> 强总么就是最讨厌的，有谁可以替代黄觉来演？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4675">77:55</a> 从谁没参加这个剧很可惜聊到胡歌的演技</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4960">82:40</a> 电视剧的配乐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5562">92:42</a> 要是每个人都有游本昌的演技，就不需要人物小传交代了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5690">94:50</a> 从没看过王家卫电影的大波哥对拍摄风格的评价</span></p><p><span>然后收尾部分因为忘记按录制箭⏺️ 我们重录了一次，好些内容没了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5738">95:38</a> 请原谅突兀结尾</span></p><p><span>我们下次江湖再见！</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
