  <item>
    <title>vol.19 从桃花坞到我的人间烟火</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d10183e490c5dee5cfa86b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d10183e490c5dee5cfa86b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Aug 2023 14:36:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期其实是一个多月前线下聊的，聊了聊关于桃花坞、杨洋、魏大勋的话题，因为主播很懒一直没剪辑，所以等到综艺剧集都播完了才放出这碗冷饭，希望有听众能听到我们这小小的节目并产生共鸣吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> </span><strong><span>《五十公里桃花坞》部分</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> </span><em><span>三季的区别</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> </span><em><span>那些名场面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 我们喜欢哪些嘉宾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 第三季最爱的场面是在海边雨中玩耍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 从鸟鸟身上学习的社交技巧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 宋丹丹在节目中的作用</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 650是节目的灵魂吗？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> </span></em><strong><span>《我的人间烟火》部分</span></strong><em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 蚯蚓对魏大勋观感的改变历程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 为什么曾经对魏大勋粉转路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 客观评价魏大勋在《我的人间烟火》中的表现</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> </span><em><span>来听听杨洋粉丝的心声</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> </span><em><span>杨洋到底油不油？</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> </span><em><span>男女主有没有cp感</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> </span><em><span>审美是一件主观的事情</span></em><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3285">54:45</a> </span><em><span>红不红是玄学</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> </span><strong><span>展望最新一季《披襟斩棘的哥哥》部分</span></strong></p>]]></description>
