  <item>
    <title>追星番外3: 哥哥开心就好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6321c2e022c073c39bfa408f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6321c2e022c073c39bfa408f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Sep 2022 12:02:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>瞎聊一期，友情提示本期音质略糟糕，还请见谅。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 利物浦新赛季表现</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 宝宝开喷《披襟斩棘》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 《披襟斩棘》舞美喧宾夺主</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 以郑钧为首的哥哥们只是待在自己的舒适圈里，毫无挑战</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 摸着良心说挺喜欢吴卓羲小组的《世界第一等》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 虽然喜欢苏有朋，但还是要有一说一的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 阿宝真的很严格</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 情怀不能卖两次</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 突然说到恋综《心动的信号》/《怦然心动20岁》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 恋综里落单的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 《心动的信号》观察室表现实在糟糕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 剪辑刻意，太低俗！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 说回《披襟斩棘》，来上这个节目的哥哥到底想干嘛？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 综艺上太多的确会影响演戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> Angelababy演艺之路的遐想</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 宝宝为什么没有那么关心鹿晗哥哥了？</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
