  <item>
    <title>追星番外2:《披荆斩棘》第一集观后漫谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6301045990403d499b54d371</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6301045990403d499b54d371</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Aug 2022 15:57:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>part1 大波哥再爱吴卓羲一次</span><br></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 哥哥台上台下表现评价：哥哥实力还没展现出来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 没想到镜头还是蛮多的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 归来仍是少年</span></p><p><em><span>🎵别怪他</span></em><br><strong><span>part2 印象深刻的其他哥哥和表演</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 潘玮柏和吴克群这一批台湾流行乐歌手</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 王大陆是不是帅哥？答案：是猿系帅哥。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 吴建豪一拖三太惨了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 苏有朋yyds</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 任贤齐、黄义达...（大波才艺展示环节）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 对哥哥们分组的感想</span></p><p><em><span>🎵小虎队组曲</span></em><br><span>part3《披荆斩棘的哥哥》与《乘风破浪的姐姐》对比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 初舞台形式设置</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 《披巾斩棘的哥哥》也能受欢迎的原因</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 我们看这两个节目到底是为了看什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 看哥哥是看个乐，看姐姐是在寻求意义</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
